
>> city := Lis ← ['London'] ; ['Paris'] ; ['Berlin'].
>> temperature := Lis ← ['15'] ; ['16'] ; ['15'].
>> weather := temperature dapre: city.
>> cities := weather kle-yo triye: { :a :b <- (a konpare: b). }.
>> temperatures := weather valè-yo triye: { :a :b <- (a konpare: b) negatif?. }.

Sòti ekri: (cities kole-ansanm: [',']), nouvo-liy.
Sòti ekri: (temperatures kole-ansanm: [',']), nouvo-liy.
